# v6: `npm run build` writes the generated files to build/ (ARCHITECTURE §14.1). The 6.0.0 release commit copies
# wasm/ihn.wasm, offline-assets.js, native-assets.json and index.html from build/ over the tree and commits them
# (§14.2/§14.3: the deployed site and the Android local assets are the committed files). The e2e-only test build is
# never committed or deployed.
